+# Corpus fetching notes
+
+## Rate limit
+
+The fetch had to respect Svipall's per-domain rate limit:
+
+- **12 visits per 60 s window**, per domain
+- **900 s cooldown** imposed after a breach
+
+## Mirror / CDN hosts
+
+Files were fetched raw via:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (observed slow / prone to timeouts)
+
+`manifest.tsv` records the repo/branch/path entries located via GitHub code
+search (grep.app) on 2026-09-12 and fetched raw via `raw.githubusercontent.com`.
